  {"i":5659,"t":["society"],"s":{"2":["culture"]},"n":"Relief/aid is taught with social issues; religious salvation goes to culture; 'actions' is too loose"},
  {"i":5669,"t":["business","money"],"n":"Learners meet 運用 as managing funds or systems (資金の運用); boat steering is rare; 'actions' is too loose"},
  {"i":5685,"t":["work","society"],"n":"Carrying out tests, plans or policies (試験を実施, 政策を実施) is work and public affairs, not hand actions"},
  {"i":5690,"t":["business"],"n":"Distribution of goods and money is the learner sense; air or water circulation is uncommon and doesn't fit 'nature'"},
  {"i":5694,"t":["actions"],"n":"General abstract noun for restraint or suppression, used across economics and medicine; 'law' is only a loose association"},
  {"i":5739,"t":["work","business"],"n":"Personnel/HR is the learner sense; 'human affairs' is literary and needs no sense entry"},
  {"i":5755,"t":["numbers","money"],"n":"Dividing amounts, typically in 分割払い (instalment payment); 'actions' is too loose"},
  {"i":5769,"t":["transport","money","city"],"s":{"2":["work","communication"]},"n":"The counter at stations, banks, post offices and ward offices, not shops, which have レジ; point of contact is work and communication"},
