 "d": [
  {"i":5659,"keep":[],"n":"Religious salvation is a specialised sense a learner rarely meets; the word is taught for relief and aid."},
  {"i":5664,"keep":[3],"n":"Conflict, as in 貿易摩擦, is a very common sense in news and social topics."},
  {"i":5668,"keep":[],"n":"Counter for pitches is a rare baseball-specific use."},
  {"i":5678,"keep":[],"n":"The farmhouse sense is taught with farmers and farming; no separate home or city unit is needed."},
  {"i":5708,"keep":[3],"n":"On its own, 定期 commonly means the commuter pass (transport). The deposit sense mostly appears as 定期預金, so it is dropped."},
  {"i":5715,"keep":[2],"n":"Political corruption (政治の腐敗) is a common sense that belongs to society."},
  {"i":5716,"keep":[],"n":"Standalone しん is rare at this level. Faith appears in compounds like 信仰, and the message counter is rare."},
  {"i":5728,"keep":[],"n":"At this level 機構 is met as organization or structure; the mechanism sense is rarer."},
  {"i":5754,"keep":[4,5],"n":"Cards in karuta and shrine charms (お札) are both common senses a learner meets in those units."},
  {"i":5769,"keep":[2],"n":"Point of contact (担当窓口) is a common workplace sense."},
  {"i":5773,"keep":[1],"n":"A picture frame (額に入れる) is common and fits the home and arts units."},
  {"i":5779,"keep":[2],"n":"Noh theatre is a core culture and arts item."},
  {"i":5785,"keep":[],"n":"The wind-instrument sense lives in 管楽器, and the tube counter is rare."},
  {"i":5791,"keep":[2],"n":"Freezing assets, accounts or prices is a common sense in economic news."},
  {"i":5800,"keep":[],"n":"Communication or exchange is an archaic or literary sense of 交通."}
 ]
